If you don't have anything to throw at it, you can go up; on the first
level those ^ are pits, not holes, and you can just crawl through.
Sokoban has four guaranteed wands, making it quite likely that at least
one of them will be teleportation or non-destructive attack (fire, cold,
lightning, magic missile). Also, monsters may leave darts, daggers and
knives that you can throw. If all else fails, you can always break the
boulder on your way out; it's only one point of luck penalty that will
clear up soon enough.

